AB  - Explainable artificial intelligence (XAI) is vital in measuring the trustworthiness and transparency of emotional AI systems. AI is continuously integrating with human emotional quotients, so trust is a critical element in sensitive domains such as healthcare, customer service, financial systems, and human-robot interaction. This chapter explores the practical application of XAI in emotional AI, where we explore the key shortcomings of AI systems like bias mitigation and decision-making on appropriate ethical terms. Further we check various XAI methods in affective computing systems and making them understandable to the end users. Additionally, we also look into the various real world case studies in which XAI improves transparency on AI applications that are driven emotionally, which ensure that the emotional quotient remains at utmost priority and is ethically aligned with human values.
