AB  - Cloud native engineering is redefining IT sector management by leveraging artificial intelligence (AI) to transform Enterprise Resource Planning (ERP) systems into agile, secure, and scalable cloud-based solutions. This chapter explores how integrating AI with cloud native ERP architectures not only streamlines critical business operations—ranging from finance and human resources to supply chain management—but also reinforces security measures and regulatory compliance in a dynamic digital environment. By harnessing containerization, microservices, and continuous integration/continuous delivery (CI/CD) practices, cloud native ERP systems facilitate rapid deployment and real-time data analysis. These advances enable proactive threat detection, automated compliance auditing, and robust privacy safeguards, thereby ensuring adherence to global data protection laws such as GDPR and CCPA. Ultimately, this integration paves the way for a resilient IT ecosystem that adapts seamlessly to evolving business needs and cybersecurity challenges.
